<https://data.archives.gov.on.test.gbad.ca/KB/NaturalAgentName/Trade%20Development%20Branch> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#AgentName> .
