<https://data.archives.gov.on.test.gbad.ca/KB/Agent/Ontario.%20Forest%20Protection%20Branch> <https://data.archives.gov.on.test.gbad.ca/Schema/Authority/functionNote> "The Forest Protection Branch was responsible for protecting Ontario's forests from fire, insects and disease. It also operated and maintained an aircraft fleet to meet the flying requirements of the Department of Lands and Forests and other Departments of the Government of Ontario." .
