<https://data.archives.gov.on.test.gbad.ca/KB/Agent/Ontario.%20Legislative%20Assembly.%20Select%20Committee%20on%20Common%20and%20Grammar%20Schools> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#history> "Select Committees are ad-hoc committees of the Legislative Assembly of Ontario with specific terms of reference to investigate and report on a specific issue. This select committee was established on November 17th, 1868, with M.C. Cameron as Chair. It made its report on January 19, 1869." .
