<https://data.archives.gov.on.test.gbad.ca/KB/Agent/Grobb%2C%20Reita%20Margaret%20%281910-1988%29> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#history> "Reita Margaret Grobb was born February 3, 1910 to John Delbert Grobb and Leatha Tallman Grobb. She grew up on the Grobb family farm in Beamsville Ontario, before graduating from the Hamilton Normal School in 1932. She worked as a teacher for seven years before working as an accounting clerk in St. Catharines for 25 years. She retired to Grimsby, Ontario, and died April 8, 1988." .
