<https://data.archives.gov.on.test.gbad.ca/KB/Agent/Ontario.%20Office%20of%20the%20Provincial%20Municipal%20Auditor> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#history> "The Office of the Provincial Municipal Auditor was established in 1897. The Auditor reported to the Attorney General of Ontario from 1897 to 1914, and after that to the Provincial Secretary. The Provincial Municipal Auditor was transferred to the newly created Bureau of Municipal Affairs in 1917." .
