<https://data.archives.gov.on.test.gbad.ca/KB/Agent/Ontario.%20Land%20Management%20Division> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#history> "The Land Management Division was created in 1971 within the Department of Lands and Forests. It oversaw the activities of the Environmental Protection Branch, the Lands and Waters Branch, and the Surveys and the Engineering Branch. The division was eliminated at the time of the creation of the Ministry of Natural Resources on April 1, 1972. Within the new ministry, its functions were assumed by the Division of Lands and the Field Services Division." .
